<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-BRAUN WINS WORLD HEPTATHLON TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BRAUN WINS WORLD HEPTATHLON TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Sabine Braun won the world heptathlon gold medal on the third day of the world championships on Monday.</p>
<p>Denise Lewis of Britain took the silver and Lithuanian Remigia Nazaroviene the bronze.</p>
</text>
